{"3574570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Roots Of Ruin", "steam_appid": 3574570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend Against Massive Waves</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/c935b2f8dc5bf5bd3e81a0cc4625716f.poster.avif?t=1786870694\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/c935b2f8dc5bf5bd3e81a0cc4625716f.webm?t=1786870694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/c935b2f8dc5bf5bd3e81a0cc4625716f.mp4?t=1786870694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold back relentless hordes of corrupted enemies using carefully placed towers, powerful defenses, and clever strategy. Every wave pushes your fortress to its limits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch Your Defenses Come to Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/2af44562c5d986b143ff44cc0315148a.poster.avif?t=1786870694\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/2af44562c5d986b143ff44cc0315148a.webm?t=1786870694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/2af44562c5d986b143ff44cc0315148a.mp4?t=1786870694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tower is constructed piece by piece before joining the fight. Expand your arsenal with unique defensive structures, each offering different strengths against the corruption.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand Your Kingdom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/2e9f50e476aff451ae270781fa62ed56.poster.avif?t=1786870694\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/2e9f50e476aff451ae270781fa62ed56.webm?t=1786870694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/2e9f50e476aff451ae270781fa62ed56.mp4?t=1786870694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaim lost land by constructing new islands and unlocking new areas. Every expansion opens new strategic possibilities, resources, and defensive positions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Beside Your Towers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/1fc1f65592e3a1b0934cf67941b8690d.poster.avif?t=1786870694\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/1fc1f65592e3a1b0934cf67941b8690d.webm?t=1786870694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/1fc1f65592e3a1b0934cf67941b8690d.mp4?t=1786870694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're more than a commander. Take direct control of your hero, grapple across the battlefield, and turn the tide of battle with powerful abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Unique Heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/fe5b520c5e5691db7f9e6687bc8488dd.poster.avif?t=1786870694\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/fe5b520c5e5691db7f9e6687bc8488dd.webm?t=1786870694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/fe5b520c5e5691db7f9e6687bc8488dd.mp4?t=1786870694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from four heroes, each with their own abilities, progression, and playstyle. Unlock new powers and become the deciding force against the corrupted invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/f1b115efd71df55300e53b73bdaacf4c.poster.avif?t=1786870694\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/f1b115efd71df55300e53b73bdaacf4c.webm?t=1786870694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/f1b115efd71df55300e53b73bdaacf4c.mp4?t=1786870694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend Against Massive Waves</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/c935b2f8dc5bf5bd3e81a0cc4625716f.poster.avif?t=1786870694\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/c935b2f8dc5bf5bd3e81a0cc4625716f.webm?t=1786870694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/c935b2f8dc5bf5bd3e81a0cc4625716