eas. Every expansion opens new strategic possibilities, resources, and defensive positions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Beside Your Towers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/1fc1f65592e3a1b0934cf67941b8690d.poster.avif?t=1786870694\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/1fc1f65592e3a1b0934cf67941b8690d.webm?t=1786870694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/1fc1f65592e3a1b0934cf67941b8690d.mp4?t=1786870694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're more than a commander. Take direct control of your hero, grapple across the battlefield, and turn the tide of battle with powerful abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Unique Heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/fe5b520c5e5691db7f9e6687bc8488dd.poster.avif?t=1786870694\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/fe5b520c5e5691db7f9e6687bc8488dd.webm?t=1786870694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574570/extras/fe5b520c5e5691db7f9e6687bc8488dd.mp4?t=1786870694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from four heroes, each with their own abilities, progression, and playstyle. Unlock new powers and become the deciding force against the corrupted invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop pl